      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>지적삼각점측량에서</keyword>
        <keyword>대회</keyword>
        <keyword>방향관측법으</keyword>
        <keyword>수평각</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>0도, 60도, 120도</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 지적측량 · 방향관측법의 윤곽도
정답은 ②이다. 지적삼각점측량의 수평각은 3대회 방향관측법으로 관측하며, 눈금 오차를 고르게 분산시키기 위해 윤곽도를 180°/3 간격인 0°, 60°, 120°로 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0도, 30도, 60도</choice_text>
          <commentary>30° 간격이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>0도, 60도, 120도</choice_text>
          <commentary>0°, 60°, 120°이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0도, 90도, 180도</choice_text>
          <commentary>90° 간격이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0도, 120도, 240도</choice_text>
          <commentary>120° 간격이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
