    <question_explanation no="13" id="PRB-F1D9F3D420BD431B-Q13">
      <question_stem>A, B 두 사람이 동일한 거리(L)를 여러 번 반복 측정하여 얻은 결과가 다음과 같을 때, 거리(L)의 최확값[m]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>사람</keyword>
        <keyword>동일한</keyword>
        <keyword>거리</keyword>
        <keyword>여러</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>50.002</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 지적측량 · 경중률을 고려한 최확값
정답은 ④이다. 경중률은 표준오차의 제곱에 반비례하므로 A : B = 1/0.008² : 1/0.004² = 1 : 4이다. 최확값은 (49.994 × 1 + 50.004 × 4)/5 = 250.010/5 = 50.002m이다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>B의 결과 $L_{B}$ = 50.004 m ± 0.004 m</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>49.996</choice_text>
          <commentary>49.996m가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>49.998</choice_text>
          <commentary>49.998m가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>50.000</choice_text>
          <commentary>단순평균 49.999m에 가깝다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>50.002</choice_text>
          <commentary>50.002m이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
