    <question_explanation no="18" id="PRB-F1D9F3D420BD431B-Q18">
      <question_stem>사진크기 20 cm × 20 cm, 초점거리 150 mm의 항공 카메라를 이용하여 종중복도 70 %, 축척 1 : 2000의 연직사진을 얻었을 때, 기선고도비는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>사진크기</keyword>
        <keyword>초점거리</keyword>
        <keyword>항공</keyword>
        <keyword>카메라</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>0.40</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 지적측량 · 기선고도비
정답은 ①이다. 촬영기선길이는 B = ma(1 − p) = 2,000 × 0.2m × 0.3 = 120m이고, 촬영고도는 H = mf = 2,000 × 0.15m = 300m이다. 기선고도비 B/H = 120/300 = 0.40이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>0.40</choice_text>
          <commentary>0.40이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.53</choice_text>
          <commentary>0.53이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.93</choice_text>
          <commentary>중복도를 반대로 적용한 값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.07</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.07이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="19" id="PRB-F1D9F3D420BD431B-Q19">
      <question_stem>초점거리 8.0 mm, 픽셀 크기 2.5 µm의 디지털 카메라가 탑재된 드론으로 지상표본거리(GSD) 5 cm인 디지털 영상을 얻고자 할 때, 촬영고도[m]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>탑재된 드론으로 지상표본거리(GSD)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>160</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 지적측량 · 지상표본거리와 촬영고도
정답은 ②이다. GSD = 픽셀 크기 × H/f이므로 H = GSD × f/픽셀 크기 = 0.05m × 0.008m/(2.5 × 10⁻⁶m) = 160m이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>100</choice_text>
          <commentary>100m가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>160</choice_text>
          <commentary>160m이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>250</choice_text>
          <commentary>250m가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>400</choice_text>
          <commentary>400m가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
